<title>LATVIA: C.BANK SETS UNCHANGED DEPO RATE, SETS REPO RATES.</title>
<headline>C.BANK SETS UNCHANGED DEPO RATE, SETS REPO RATES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said on Friday that it will next week accept 31-day deposits from commercial banks at an unchanged two percent.</p>
<p>The deposits can be made on April 28 and will be repaid with interest on May 29, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank also set a one-month repo rate of 4.50 percent, three-month at 5 percent, six-month at 5.75 percent and 12-months at 7 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said the rates were valid until April 25.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
